  ExampleLabels:
  - 'Hard shadows: two point lights - one static, one following the mouse - cast
    crisp-edged shadows.'
  - 'Soft shadows: a blurred point light casting soft penumbra edges.'
  - 'Ambient light: iterative ambient bounce propagating from an emitter into open
    space.'
  - 'Colored obstacles: occluders tint the light passing through them (colored shadows).'
  - 'Animated obstacles: flying bats act as dynamic occluders that sweep animated
    shadows.'
  - 'Water: a translucent water body tints the light while glowing emissive spray
    drifts across it.'
  - 'Fountain: an upward jet of glowing emissive particles arcs and falls over a
    lit water basin.'
  - 'Moving obstacles: two counter-rotating rings of block occluders orbit a central
    light, sweeping shadows.'
  - 'Moving lights: many point lights fly around independently through a static maze
    of obstacles.'
  Ui: {fileID: 1370536895}
